<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    position: 'relative',
    background: '#F7F3EA',
    padding: 0,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, left: 0,
        width: '420px', height: '720px',
        background: '#0B3D2E',
        padding: '68px 44px 56px 72px',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        justifyContent: 'space-between',
    }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 3, background: '#C75B12' }} />
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 38,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#F7F3EA',
                lineHeight: 1.32,
                letterSpacing: 3,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                討論和表決
                <br />
                是兩個階段
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 2, background: 'rgba(240,160,80,.5)' }} />
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 19,
                color: '#F0A050',
                lineHeight: 1.7,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                討論完了再投票。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, right: 0,
        width: '860px', height: '720px',
        padding: '58px 68px 50px 48px',
        flexDirection: 'column',
    }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center', height: 62 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#C75B12' }} />
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 32,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#0B3D2E',
                letterSpacing: 1,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                兩種做法，兩種結果
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: 0, minHeight: 0, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, paddingTop: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1, minWidth: 0, minHeight: 0,
                background: '#FFFFFF',
                border: '1px solid rgba(11,61,46,.14)',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: '24px 30px',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 12,
                boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(11,61,46,.07)',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='times-circle' style={{ fill: '#8A8578', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: '#5C5850', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                        揉在一起的流程
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5C5850', lineHeight: 1.72 }}>
                    討論到第三輪，主持人開始暗示自己希望通過的方向，接著問「大家還有沒有意見」，然後在沉默中宣布通過。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(11,61,46,.12)', paddingTop: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8A8578', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                        通過的不是經過比較的方案，而是所有人都沒有力氣反對的方案
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                flex: 1, minWidth: 0, minHeight: 0,
                background: '#0B3D2E',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: '24px 30px',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 12,
                boxShadow: '0 6px 24px rgba(11,61,46,.18)',
            }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#F0A050', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: '#F7F3EA', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                        正確的做法
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.80)', lineHeight: 1.72 }}>
                    依序走完八步，把結論留在「確認決議事項」這一步：把決議重新念一遍並在場確認，討論才算真正結束。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(240,160,80,.24)', paddingTop: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#F0A050', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                        白紙黑字誰負責，比什麼都重要
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8578', letterSpacing: 1 }}>高效會議主持 SOP</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8578', letterSpacing: 1 }}>12 / 14</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
